WEBVTT

00:18.240 --> 00:29.330
<b>The Reincarnation of
the Strongest Exorcist in Another World</b>

01:32.140 --> 01:34.080
Summer break starts tomorrow.

01:34.080 --> 01:35.820
You guys are all going home, right?

01:36.360 --> 01:41.120
Actually, I was told out of the blue to go 
investigate a dragon in the Kingdom of Astiria.

01:41.120 --> 01:42.660
Why you?

01:42.930 --> 01:46.380
A member of the Astirian 
Diet asked my dad to go,

01:46.380 --> 01:49.850
but he's busy, so I'm going in his place.

01:49.850 --> 01:54.180
His grades are good, so his father must've 
thought he was perfect for the job.

01:54.180 --> 01:55.840
I didn't have any plans, anyway.

01:56.240 --> 01:58.370
That sounds fun!

01:58.370 --> 01:59.810
Can I go with you?

01:59.810 --> 02:04.220
Don't be silly. Your parents are 
waiting for you at home, aren't they?

02:04.220 --> 02:06.700
You're no fun.

02:06.700 --> 02:08.850
What about me? I don't have any plans.

02:09.110 --> 02:09.980
Sure you do.

02:10.750 --> 02:12.170
Studying.

02:12.170 --> 02:15.320
And you've got parents 
waiting for you, too, right?

02:16.890 --> 02:18.240
I'll stay here, then.

02:21.510 --> 02:23.540
Yifa, will you come with me?

02:24.350 --> 02:26.160
I won't force you to.

02:26.160 --> 02:27.880
Y-Yes, yes I will!

02:27.880 --> 02:30.180
So when are you leaving?

02:34.250 --> 02:36.190
So this is the place, huh?

02:36.190 --> 02:38.380
It's such an old building, though!

02:38.380 --> 02:40.260
It's so modest!

02:40.550 --> 02:43.600
You should rebuild it!

02:43.600 --> 02:44.510
Sire.

02:45.350 --> 02:49.140
Sorry, forget I said that.

02:49.140 --> 02:51.000
Who's that?

02:51.710 --> 02:53.120
Is that him, then?

02:53.120 --> 02:54.700
Thanks for bringing me here.

02:55.650 --> 02:59.040
Hey. You're Lord Seika, right?

02:59.040 --> 02:59.610
Yes...

03:00.060 --> 03:04.200
I'm Cecilio, crown prince of Astiria.

03:05.510 --> 03:08.280
An honor to meet you, Prince.

03:08.280 --> 03:12.500
You didn't need to come all the 
way here. I would've come to you.

03:12.500 --> 03:17.580
I wanted to see the Empire's magic 
academy while I was meeting you.

03:18.790 --> 03:21.560
You can really feel the history here...

03:23.230 --> 03:24.720
What's your name?

03:25.770 --> 03:29.270
Um... Yifa.

03:29.790 --> 03:31.690
You're so beautiful...

03:32.060 --> 03:37.230
You must be a wise and noble lady, 
to be able to study at this school!

03:37.760 --> 03:42.700
I'd like you to join my country's 
harem and become one of my wives!

03:46.330 --> 03:50.380
I-I'm sorry, I'm a slave...

03:50.380 --> 03:54.170
And Seika's servant... I can't...

03:55.110 --> 03:59.510
I see. Lord Seika, just 
name your price for her!

03:59.810 --> 04:01.550
U-Um...

04:03.250 --> 04:05.090
Sire, this isn't the place.

04:05.090 --> 04:06.710
Let's go somewhere else.

04:06.710 --> 04:08.220
Yes, you're right.

04:08.220 --> 04:10.890
<i>I'm worried about this guy...</i>

04:12.750 --> 04:16.990
Has your father told you about 
the matter with the dragon?

04:16.990 --> 04:21.060
Yes, by letter. 
Can you tell me in more detail?

04:21.060 --> 04:23.990
Yes, about that, Lord Seika...

04:24.320 --> 04:28.300
Before that, Prince, you 
don't need to call me "Lord."

04:28.730 --> 04:31.040
My father hasn't given me his title.

04:31.610 --> 04:33.440
I hadn't realized.

04:33.440 --> 04:35.800
I'll just call you "Seika," then.

04:35.800 --> 04:36.420
Thank you.

04:36.420 --> 04:41.310
Now, the dragon of Astiria 
has lived in harmony

04:41.310 --> 04:44.500
with the people of its 
land for over a century.

04:44.500 --> 04:49.620
Supposedly, it once fought alongside my 
ancestors to drive away an invading army.

04:50.580 --> 04:55.230
But it's been acting strangely 
over the past year...

04:55.230 --> 04:58.520
Attacking crops and cattle, yes?

04:59.040 --> 05:01.670
It's not a serious matter right now.

05:01.670 --> 05:04.150
But the damage is getting worse by the day.

05:04.150 --> 05:10.280
First, why has the Astirian dragon lived 
in harmony with the people there until now?

05:10.280 --> 05:12.870
I don't know the exact reasons,

05:12.870 --> 05:15.680
but the legends say that many years ago,

05:15.680 --> 05:19.990
it was hatched from an egg 
by the queen of Astiria.

05:19.990 --> 05:21.500
A dragon, hatched by human hands?

05:21.500 --> 05:23.830
These are just legends.

05:23.830 --> 05:27.620
But I'd like you to 
investigate them, as well.

05:27.620 --> 05:29.580
I understand, Prince.

05:29.580 --> 05:30.800
Thank you.

05:31.850 --> 05:33.180
I know.

05:33.450 --> 05:35.300
Why don't we have dinner this evening?

05:35.300 --> 05:37.310
Sire, restrain yourself.

05:37.310 --> 05:39.020
I know, Lize.

05:39.450 --> 05:41.590
I'll be going, then.

05:41.590 --> 05:42.870
All right, Your Highness.

05:49.620 --> 05:50.710
Ow...

05:50.710 --> 05:51.830
Quiet.

05:52.640 --> 05:55.030
Now, tell us everything.

05:57.790 --> 06:01.040
You're not going to give him Yifa, are you?

06:01.280 --> 06:03.260
No way!

06:03.260 --> 06:06.920
I mean, he sure seemed to like her...

06:06.920 --> 06:09.760
So if that's what Yifa wants...

06:10.010 --> 06:12.300
Then, she'll join his harem?

06:12.300 --> 06:14.450
What's gotten into you?

06:14.450 --> 06:16.860
There's no way she'd say that.

06:16.860 --> 06:19.230
Please don't tell her that.

06:19.230 --> 06:21.560
I think it would make her sad.

06:21.560 --> 06:22.630
Why?

06:22.630 --> 06:26.220
If I don't bring it up first, she might not 
be able to say she wants to go with him.

06:26.220 --> 06:27.420
Please.

06:27.900 --> 06:29.170
Fine.

06:30.150 --> 06:31.760
<i>Two days later,</i>

06:31.760 --> 06:36.660
<i>Yifa and I left the school along with 
the prince's carriage and its escorts.</i>

06:38.330 --> 06:40.430
Are you okay, Seika?

06:40.430 --> 06:41.750
You don't feel well?

06:41.750 --> 06:44.800
Yeah. I know I need to get used to it...

06:44.800 --> 06:48.490
We don't get a lot of chances 
to go to other countries, though.

06:48.490 --> 06:50.050
I guess I should thank the dragon.

06:50.050 --> 06:51.450
It's amazing, isn't it?

06:51.450 --> 06:54.370
A dragon, living alongside humans?

06:54.370 --> 06:57.440
Will we be able to ride on its 
back like a dragon knight?

06:57.440 --> 06:59.600
That's just a fairy tale.

06:59.600 --> 07:01.950
You do love those, don't you?

07:01.950 --> 07:03.190
Maybe I do.

07:03.190 --> 07:09.030
Oh, right. Prince Cecilio asked me to 
ride in his carriage before we left.

07:09.700 --> 07:12.940
He said he wanted to tell 
me all about the dragon.

07:14.280 --> 07:16.010
I wasn't sure what to say.

07:16.010 --> 07:20.540
I don't think he actually wants to 
add a girl like me to his harem.

07:20.540 --> 07:24.040
No, I think he was serious...

07:24.420 --> 07:28.340
Was he? If so, that makes me a little happy.

07:28.340 --> 07:30.670
<i>I don't know what this feeling 
is, but I don't like it...</i>

07:30.670 --> 07:33.120
You're looking kind of pale. 
Are you okay?

07:33.120 --> 07:34.440
Y-Yeah...

07:35.430 --> 07:42.350
<i>It was nine days later when we reached 
the old capital of Astiria, Protoaster.</i>

07:43.060 --> 07:44.690
We're finally here.

07:44.690 --> 07:47.320
I'll never get used to carriages...

07:50.440 --> 07:52.240
This place is great.

07:54.330 --> 07:56.450
It's a nice place, yeah.

07:56.450 --> 07:57.910
Right?

07:58.650 --> 08:02.850
But since the dragon started attacking 
things, everyone's gotten scared.

08:02.850 --> 08:05.290
Trade has gotten more difficult.

08:11.010 --> 08:14.840
It started to fly around 
this area a while ago.

08:14.840 --> 08:16.630
It's quite sizable.

08:16.630 --> 08:19.180
They call it a "greater dragon."

08:26.480 --> 08:28.360
Come forth from the land of the inferno.

08:29.130 --> 08:30.620
Lava Tiger!

08:55.260 --> 08:56.090
<i>Shoot!</i>

08:56.090 --> 08:57.180
<i>Phase of earth.</i>

08:57.560 --> 08:59.390
<i>Spell of Transparent Fortress!</i>

09:01.270 --> 09:04.350
<i>That armor's hotter than I thought.</i>

09:21.410 --> 09:22.830
Stay.

09:23.420 --> 09:26.420
This thing never behaves.

09:27.840 --> 09:29.660
Calm down.

09:29.660 --> 09:31.720
That's a violation of your contract.

09:33.820 --> 09:35.050
<i>A summoner.</i>

09:36.160 --> 09:37.880
Enough. Return.

09:39.560 --> 09:41.600
That was dangerous.

09:41.600 --> 09:43.710
You okay, Prince Cecilio?

09:43.710 --> 09:45.890
Zekt, what were you thinking?

09:46.230 --> 09:49.600
You almost hurt a guest from the Empire.

09:49.600 --> 09:51.260
I've got bigger things to worry about.

09:51.260 --> 09:55.180
The situation with the dragon 
changed while you were gone.

09:55.180 --> 09:56.190
What do you mean?

09:56.190 --> 09:59.150
It's been in a very bad 
mood for the past few days.

09:59.150 --> 10:01.530
It's started to attack people.

10:01.530 --> 10:03.660
Like you just saw, right?

10:04.410 --> 10:06.250
<i>Who the hell is this guy?</i>

10:06.500 --> 10:08.470
Who's this, Prince?

10:08.470 --> 10:14.170
Sorry. This is Zekt, the head 
of a mercenary group I hired.

10:14.460 --> 10:19.480
Zekt, this is the emissary here to 
investigate the dragon, Seika Lamprogue.

10:19.480 --> 10:21.550
Be on your best behavior around him.

10:22.610 --> 10:24.900
So this brat's a... Ahem, I mean...

10:24.900 --> 10:28.850
It's amazing you're an emissary at your age.

10:29.440 --> 10:32.230
Why hire mercenaries?

10:33.840 --> 10:35.780
To slay the dragon.

10:35.780 --> 10:36.840
Slay it?

10:36.840 --> 10:40.090
It's the only way to put an end to this.

10:40.090 --> 10:41.550
And you think they're capable?

10:41.550 --> 10:47.290
Yes. You saw Zekt's Lava Tiger 
drive away the dragon, right?

10:47.880 --> 10:53.010
<i>Yeah, that armor might block 
the dragon's attacks, but...</i>

10:53.010 --> 10:56.320
I think you should reconsider, Prince.

10:56.320 --> 10:58.130
Their difference in size makes it impossible.

10:58.400 --> 11:00.150
And the worst-case scenario

11:00.150 --> 11:03.840
would be if the dragon left this realm 
and attacked another country.

11:04.750 --> 11:08.890
Hey, I've slain tons of dragons.

11:09.310 --> 11:12.540
Stay out of this, spoiled little rich kid.

11:12.540 --> 11:13.910
I apologize.

11:13.910 --> 11:16.090
That was certainly a close call, though.

11:16.090 --> 11:18.190
I'm glad I was able to stop it.

11:19.120 --> 11:21.260
That earth magic was you?

11:21.260 --> 11:23.870
I didn't need your help 
to keep it under control.

11:23.870 --> 11:26.250
Keep it under control? No.

11:26.250 --> 11:32.040
Don't summon your precious little beasts 
anywhere I can see them, is what I meant.

11:32.290 --> 11:35.040
<i>I was about to blast it into ash.</i>

11:36.090 --> 11:37.510
Stop it!

11:37.510 --> 11:38.960
That's enough!

11:39.230 --> 11:42.530
Zekt, I just told you not to be rude.

11:42.530 --> 11:43.680
Get back inside.

11:44.320 --> 11:45.300
Right, right.

11:45.570 --> 11:47.100
Let's go, men.

11:48.610 --> 11:51.680
And you, too, Seika.

11:51.680 --> 11:54.550
You should know better than 
to provoke a thug like that.

11:54.550 --> 11:55.520
I'm sorry.

11:55.520 --> 11:58.570
My servant was put in danger, 
and I couldn't help myself.

11:58.570 --> 12:00.520
Now, regarding what we were discussing.

12:00.520 --> 12:05.280
Have the queen and the people 
agreed to the slaying of the dragon?

12:05.280 --> 12:06.030
Well...

12:06.480 --> 12:09.230
The dragon is a symbol of this nation.

12:09.230 --> 12:11.510
Without the queen or the people's approval...

12:11.510 --> 12:13.740
Protoaster is my city.

12:13.740 --> 12:16.890
And I have full authority over this matter.

12:16.890 --> 12:19.090
Everyone will understand.

12:19.090 --> 12:22.050
This is my nation's problem, 
and I'd prefer you stay out of it.

12:23.600 --> 12:25.490
I've overstepped.

12:28.960 --> 12:30.600
Seika, thank you—

12:30.600 --> 12:33.370
Yifa, why didn't you use your magic?

12:34.210 --> 12:36.260
I was surprised...

12:36.260 --> 12:38.310
Are you going to die, then, \as soon as you get surprised?

12:39.790 --> 12:42.840
I'm not going to always be there.

12:42.840 --> 12:46.070
What will you do if you're 
in danger and I'm not around?

12:47.240 --> 12:50.730
I thought you were smart enough 
to know this was dangerous.

12:51.230 --> 12:53.210
Was I wrong to bring you?

12:53.210 --> 12:56.120
I-I'm sorry...

12:56.490 --> 12:59.150
You don't need to be so hard on her.

12:59.150 --> 13:03.010
It's normal to be afraid when 
a terrifying monster is around.

13:03.010 --> 13:05.020
Yifa, you don't need to worry about it.

13:05.020 --> 13:07.800
Prince, this is between Yifa and me.

13:08.640 --> 13:11.130
If you need to protect yourself, 
use your magic.

13:11.130 --> 13:14.520
And if you can't do that, you can 
run, or ask somebody for help.

13:14.520 --> 13:16.960
But you need to take action.

13:16.960 --> 13:18.440
That's the one thing you have to do.

13:18.440 --> 13:19.230
Got it?

13:19.230 --> 13:20.690
Y-Yeah.

13:22.140 --> 13:24.110
Let's head back to the carriage.

13:24.480 --> 13:25.830
Let's go, Yifa.

13:27.370 --> 13:30.270
<i>I feel a little bad for her, 
but I don't have a choice.</i>

13:30.270 --> 13:33.100
<i>Everybody gets too scared to move.</i>

13:33.100 --> 13:36.830
<i>When that happens, they need a strong 
push or they'll be paralyzed.</i>

13:37.280 --> 13:38.960
<i>In my case,</i>

13:38.960 --> 13:44.170
<i>that was seeing the one older student 
I got along with eaten in front of my eyes.</i>

13:45.020 --> 13:47.640
<i>I wasn't even thinking when I 
somehow managed to seal it away.</i>

13:47.640 --> 13:49.660
<i>I still use it as a servant.</i>

13:50.960 --> 13:54.040
<i>I don't want Yifa to go through that.</i>

14:01.850 --> 14:07.510
<i>The next day, we decided to take a look at the 
documents about the dragon at the library.</i>

14:08.770 --> 14:15.080
There. I think that's all the books on the list.

14:15.080 --> 14:16.000
Thanks.

14:17.550 --> 14:21.360
If only I could read the 
old language like you...

14:21.360 --> 14:23.000
Where'd you learn it?

14:23.470 --> 14:25.000
In the library back home.

14:26.430 --> 14:31.170
Looks like something similar 
happened about 150 years ago.

14:32.000 --> 14:32.990
Yeah?

14:32.990 --> 14:39.270
These books say the dragon was 
born several centuries ago.

14:39.850 --> 14:43.970
The legends say it was hatched 
from an egg by the queen,

14:43.970 --> 14:45.200
but it's not clear if that's true.

14:45.650 --> 14:49.280
It does appear to be true that it lived 
alongside the townspeople, though.

14:50.220 --> 14:54.310
At one point, another dragon came to Astiria.

14:54.310 --> 14:56.540
Eventually, the dragon, who was male,

14:56.540 --> 15:01.810
came to live in the mountain with 
the newly arrived female dragon.

15:01.810 --> 15:05.850
Fifty years later, the two dragons changed.

15:07.330 --> 15:11.830
They became wary, attacking stray cattle

15:11.830 --> 15:15.060
and scaring away people who come near them.

15:15.060 --> 15:16.800
That's just like what's going on now.

15:16.800 --> 15:18.060
But why?

15:18.060 --> 15:19.790
They'd given birth to children.

15:19.790 --> 15:21.630
Perhaps they'd been attacking the cattle

15:21.630 --> 15:25.500
because magical power alone 
isn't enough to feed them.

15:25.500 --> 15:27.510
What happened to the kids?

15:27.510 --> 15:30.700
They left the nest when 
they grew up, it says.

15:30.990 --> 15:34.920
And then, fifty years later, 
the female dragon died.

15:34.920 --> 15:36.120
Huh? Why?

15:36.400 --> 15:38.750
The records say it was a natural death.

15:38.750 --> 15:40.960
That was 100 years ago.

15:40.960 --> 15:45.990
Then maybe this time it's 
not because they had kids?

15:45.990 --> 15:50.300
There's only one dragon 
left, and it's male...

15:51.810 --> 15:53.390
I'm going to climb the mountain.

15:54.240 --> 15:55.760
Th-The mountain?

15:55.760 --> 15:57.680
You don't mean the one the dragon lives on...

15:57.680 --> 15:58.660
Yeah.

15:58.660 --> 16:03.230
The best way to do this is to go and 
see the dragon up close, I think.

16:03.560 --> 16:05.200
I-It's dangerous!

16:05.200 --> 16:08.610
I don't think even <i>you</i> can beat a dragon...

16:08.960 --> 16:11.360
I'm not planning on fighting it.

16:11.360 --> 16:13.030
If I'm discovered, I'll just run away.

16:13.030 --> 16:14.650
R-Really?

16:14.650 --> 16:15.830
Then, I'll go, too.

16:15.830 --> 16:17.490
No, you wait here.

16:17.770 --> 16:19.000
It's too dangerous.

16:19.450 --> 16:21.040
You're right.

16:32.180 --> 16:33.540
Seika...

16:34.740 --> 16:35.720
Um...

16:35.720 --> 16:40.430
A maid just came and told me 
Prince Cecilio was calling for me.

16:41.210 --> 16:42.490
At this hour?

16:42.490 --> 16:44.270
Wh-What do I do?

16:44.270 --> 16:46.560
Oh, you don't need to go.

16:46.560 --> 16:49.440
I'll talk to that dumba—to the prince.

16:49.680 --> 16:50.730
Okay...

16:51.420 --> 16:52.400
Um...

16:52.980 --> 16:56.110
Are you scared to be in your room alone?

17:00.710 --> 17:02.530
Yifa, you can use the bed.

17:02.530 --> 17:04.530
I-I couldn't!

17:04.530 --> 17:07.930
This bed's big enough for both of us!

17:07.930 --> 17:09.380
Let's do that, then.

17:10.860 --> 17:13.550
Th-Thank you very much!

17:21.960 --> 17:24.480
What do you think about Prince Cecilio?

17:24.890 --> 17:27.650
Wh-What? I don't really 
think anything about him...

17:27.970 --> 17:30.510
Are you thinking about joining his harem?

17:30.510 --> 17:32.130
I-I am not.

17:32.130 --> 17:34.320
Why did you even bring it up?

17:34.710 --> 17:37.110
If you're not going for my sake, it's okay.

17:37.580 --> 17:39.220
You can be honest.

17:40.670 --> 17:42.090
Wh-Why?

17:42.590 --> 17:45.410
Am I that much of a bother to you?

17:46.660 --> 17:49.360
I'm sorry about yesterday...

17:49.360 --> 17:52.620
I'll learn to be able to 
use magic when I need to!

17:52.620 --> 17:57.200
A-And I'll study other languages 
so I can read them, too!

17:57.200 --> 17:58.540
S-So...

17:58.540 --> 18:01.970
No, no. That's not what I meant.

18:02.290 --> 18:05.050
It's not that you got in my way or anything.

18:05.050 --> 18:07.640
Really? Then, why?

18:07.640 --> 18:10.130
I think it's not a bad deal for you.

18:10.130 --> 18:13.320
Being invited to a royal harem is an honor.

18:14.570 --> 18:19.610
If I went to his harem, 
you wouldn't care at all?

18:19.920 --> 18:21.810
I'd miss you.

18:21.810 --> 18:25.790
But everybody has to choose 
their own path, eventually.

18:27.160 --> 18:29.280
I'll think about it, then.

18:29.280 --> 18:30.550
I'm going to sleep.

18:31.080 --> 18:32.210
Good night.

18:33.120 --> 18:35.440
Yeah. Good night.

18:41.220 --> 18:45.180
Episode 8: 
Yifa's Feelings

18:52.000 --> 18:54.700
You were a little hard on her 
last night, don't you think?

18:54.700 --> 18:55.470
How so?

18:55.470 --> 18:59.440
I'm starting to feel pity for the girl.

18:59.440 --> 19:00.700
Why, though?

19:00.700 --> 19:07.540
I told you before that 
the slave girl likes you.

19:07.540 --> 19:10.420
It's just because we grew up together...

19:10.420 --> 19:12.360
I can tell.

19:12.360 --> 19:17.340
She's been in love with 
you since she was little.

19:25.770 --> 19:29.930
Prince, I'm told you tried to 
summon my servant last night.

19:29.930 --> 19:31.730
Did you need something from her?

19:32.440 --> 19:34.870
I wanted to talk to her.

19:34.870 --> 19:36.780
She didn't take me up on my offer, though.

19:36.780 --> 19:39.150
Would you apologize to her for me?

19:39.740 --> 19:41.710
Do it yourself, please.

19:41.710 --> 19:45.070
If you're serious about inviting 
her to your harem, that is.

19:45.630 --> 19:47.500
What attracted you to her so much?

19:48.470 --> 19:51.660
Her beauty... but that's not all.

19:51.660 --> 19:54.210
She has such an air of wisdom about her!

19:54.620 --> 19:57.500
I know the two of you are very close.

19:58.150 --> 19:59.920
But I don't care.

20:00.290 --> 20:03.140
Yifa and I don't have that 
sort of relationship.

20:03.140 --> 20:05.940
Then, let me ask you once more.

20:05.940 --> 20:08.260
Would you give her to me?

20:09.130 --> 20:11.300
I'll pay as much money as you want.

20:11.300 --> 20:12.540
I refuse.

20:12.540 --> 20:15.170
Unless she herself wants to.

20:15.170 --> 20:16.400
Oh...!

20:16.630 --> 20:21.820
I'm going to climb the mountain 
where the dragon dwells, by the way.

20:21.820 --> 20:23.820
That's far too dangerous, though!

20:24.230 --> 20:25.490
It'll be fine.

20:25.960 --> 20:28.510
Well, if you say so.

20:28.510 --> 20:30.540
Just be careful...

20:30.540 --> 20:31.660
I will.

20:31.920 --> 20:36.580
<i>If he's climbing the mountain 
it'll be days before he returns.</i>

20:36.580 --> 20:40.790
<i>I hope he's not getting any ideas...</i>

20:43.170 --> 20:45.630
Are you really okay going empty-handed?

20:45.630 --> 20:46.570
I'm fine.

20:46.570 --> 20:48.110
I'll find food.

20:48.110 --> 20:50.180
Just be really careful, okay?

20:50.570 --> 20:52.680
Okay. Bye.

22:31.660 --> 22:32.780
A moment of your time.

22:34.200 --> 22:37.160
I want to talk to you in private.

22:42.120 --> 22:43.960
This is a nice place, isn't it?

22:46.080 --> 22:48.510
This place is overflowing with magical power.

22:49.100 --> 22:55.150
That magical power is the reason the 
dragon's watched over this place for so long.

22:55.150 --> 22:56.930
Is that right?

22:56.930 --> 23:00.190
I don't know a lot about magic...

23:00.190 --> 23:01.770
No, of course you do.

23:02.210 --> 23:04.380
There are so many elementals here.

23:04.380 --> 23:05.650
You don't need to try and hide it.

23:05.960 --> 23:08.070
I realized instantly.

23:08.610 --> 23:11.780
You are a descendant of us elves.

23:12.760 --> 23:14.120
I am?

23:14.500 --> 23:16.830
The elementals must have
brought us together.

23:16.830 --> 23:19.420
Come to the Astirian harem, Yifa.

23:20.190 --> 23:22.710
I appreciate the offer, really, but...

23:23.260 --> 23:26.840
Are you okay staying that 
boy's slave forever?

23:27.240 --> 23:28.760
I...

23:31.260 --> 23:33.300
You must've noticed.

23:36.270 --> 23:39.650
That boy is a monster.
